  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-082-jin044-huayi:first" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">中書監<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-082-jin044-huayi:first:m0003" ref="418_c91_b6b">華廙</persName>恐懼，自往索之，終不與。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-082-jin044-huayi:second" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">皇后召<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-082-jin044-huayi:second:m0003" ref="418_c91_b6b">華廙</persName>及中書令<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-082-jin044-huayi:second:m0009" ref="ij0_gmq_io0">何劭</persName>，口宣帝旨作詔</p>
</text>
